hared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"0wZJkj-OnZ7Pmublspl7tA","review_id":"k9MeSf3Tv_aRkrqzgeXXGQ","date":"2015-07-30T17:31:12","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9448115229606628,"text_excerpt":"The BEST pizza you're gonna get in the quarter. Possibly the entire city of New Orleans. Maybe even the entire state of Louisiana. Don't buy that trash you find on Bourbon. Get your butt over to St Louis and get in line for a slice or two of that delicious \"pep\" and a soft drink. If you're in town in a hotel, these guys deliver on bicycle, so do the smart thing and pick up the phone and call for delivery. An entire pizza is soooo worth it! Even when you're NOT trashed from partying, this is STILL the best pizza around. They load you up with toppings and if they don't have what you're looking for on a slice that they already have cooked, they'll load up what they have for you with whatever..."},{"business_id":"0wZJkj-OnZ7Pmublspl7tA","review_id":"Yl6MnsuN1ujIWXoG-vDAmQ","date":"2021-12-27T20:45:23","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9445753693580627,"text_excerpt":"Vieux Carre Pizza Ratings: 4.5/5 Food: 4.75/5 - Walking through Bourbon Street and was craving for some pizza, and feeling adventurous to try out this dry and unappetizing pizza looking place, but it turns out to be the ultimate \"mind blowing\" pizza. I had many late night pizzas in NYC and SF, and I'd say this is a top tier late night junkie pizza to go to. - Pepperoni Pizza [GET]: Huge slice of pizza with a generous amount of pepperoni on top of it. The pizza was fresh and super delicious. The dough is the highlight of the night, and I loved it. It was soft, fluffy, and pillowy, super easy to chew, but the crust was toasted perfectly. Even after a while of eating it, the dough is still i..."},{"business_id":"0wZJkj-OnZ7Pmublspl7tA","review_id":"6B-UHdWhklKPyi0DD16eSw","date":"2016-07-09T17:35:55","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.943904459476471,"text_excerpt":"Coming from Pizza City (I'm pretty sure I'm the only one that considers Chicago pizza city), I'm REALLY picky when it comes to pizza. This last time I went to New Orleans during Memorial Day weekend, we were walking around looking for a snack. You kinda have to learn the hard way there's no \"light\" snacking in NOLA. But about a block away, we saw this dude walking by eating a huge pizza by the slice and we decided we needed to find this place. Then we smelled the scent of pizza! Vieux Carre came in to view! Yaaaaaas! Now, I myself didn't get a slice, because I was trying REALLY hard not to eat so heavy so late, but I did have a bite of my sister's slice, and you know what, it was pretty g..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"0wZJkj-OnZ7Pmublspl7tA","photo_id":"eXJRQ-vbHy6qXAwt481ZlQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/eXJRQ-vbHy6qXAwt481ZlQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9124332666397095},{"business_id":"0wZJkj-OnZ7Pmublspl7tA","photo_id":"DLOQCke1IcqwOEpej_y5QQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/DLOQCke1IcqwOEpej_y5QQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8483963012695312},{"business_id":"0wZJkj-OnZ7Pmublspl7tA","photo_id":"xHw99K_uWpbz4LsT7sbcHA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/xHw99K_uWpbz4LsT7sbcHA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8401780128479004},{"business_id":"0wZJkj-OnZ7Pmublspl7tA","photo_id":"My0gNv62YFadhzJU7EYoeQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/M